CORE RESULT
Developmental commitment is better represented as:

OPTION-SPACE TRANSFORMATION

rather than:

OPTION DESTRUCTION.

The organism may trade:

MANY LOW-LEVEL OPTIONS

for:

FEWER
BUT MORE POWERFUL
HIGHER-LEVEL AFFORDANCES.

This is directly relevant to:
developmental intelligence.

